[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13262.79, "timestamp": "03:41:02", "text": "颜色很奇特。乐趣。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13265.75, "timestamp": "03:41:05", "text": "我想知道他们是什么奴隶。你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13267.59, "timestamp": "03:41:07", "text": "也很想知道它们是什么颜色的。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13270.95, "timestamp": "03:41:10", "text": "它代表什么？ H 是一个奴隶和一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13273.55, "timestamp": "03:41:13", "text": "颜色很奇特。我想知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13275.75, "timestamp": "03:41:15", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13277.99, "timestamp": "03:41:17", "text": "好的。接下来是假发冰箱。她她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13280.469, "timestamp": "03:41:20", "text": "打屎。她有一支特殊的长矛和一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13283.03, "timestamp": "03:41:23", "text": "特殊的帽子，能造成更多伤害"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13285.51, "timestamp": "03:41:25", "text": "更像是我做的那种事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13287.429, "timestamp": "03:41:27", "text": "任何。她是一名战斗型角色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13289.83, "timestamp": "03:41:29", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13293.67, "timestamp": "03:41:33", "text": "韦伯是一只蜘蛛。韦伯是一只蜘蛛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13295.11, "timestamp": "03:41:35", "text": "蜘蛛对它们很友好。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13297.59, "timestamp": "03:41:37", "text": "驯服蜘蛛。他们会为你而战。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13299.51, "timestamp": "03:41:39", "text": "可以安抚蜘蛛巢穴。你可以制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13301.429, "timestamp": "03:41:41", "text": "让他们爱上你。所有这些乐趣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13305.269, "timestamp": "03:41:45", "text": "拉屎。蜘蛛交配。乐趣。是的。威诺娜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13308.79, "timestamp": "03:41:48", "text": "工程师。母狗会造弹射器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13313.11, "timestamp": "03:41:53", "text": "就是这样。那就是粉丝。威利"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13314.71, "timestamp": "03:41:54", "text": "不要让他上场。你要潜水"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13316.469, "timestamp": "03:41:56", "text": "饥饿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13318